# --- GLM-5.3-Flash pilot scratch ---
# judging/ holds per-case candidate sources + oracle payloads written during
# judgment; they are derivative (reproducible from cases.jsonl + judgment-*.json)
experiments/glm53_flash_pilot/judging/
# deepapply-run: judging/ is the same derivative scratch. The trained adapter
# under adapter_model/ is the pilot's evidence artifact (~3 MB), so its
# safetensors file is deliberately re-included below.
experiments/glm53_flash_pilot/deepapply-run/judging/
!experiments/glm53_flash_pilot/deepapply-run/adapter_model/*.safetensors
